<title>UK: Tadpole Tech dives after listing restored.</title>
<headline>Tadpole Tech dives after listing restored.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Tadpole Technology Plc fell 8-1/2p to 15p, or 36 percent, after the shares were relisted on Thursday.</p>
<p>The computer design company's stock was suspended on April 1 and on Wednesday made a one-for-five rights issue and a placing to raise 2.26 million stg.</p>
<p>The group also released half year results showing a pre-tax loss of 2.46 million against a loss last time of 1.67 million.</p>
<p>-- Louise Ireland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4206</p>
</text>
